

=== PART 0 -- the hemispheric-asymmetry hypothesis, killed on inspection ===
`w_up` is ONE GLOBAL parameter; the test sets w_out_NH = w_out_SH = 4.
No hemisphere is swapped: each column is reversed separately and
identically. The handoff-16d hypothesis is INAPPLICABLE, not merely wrong.
Part 2 shows both hemispheres break in the SAME direction, which a swap
could not produce.


